      "CVE": "CVE-2026-61908",
      "Description": "An issue was discovered in Cyrus IMAP before 3.12.4. A JMAP email-header blob ID can reference an out-of-bounds index. An authenticated user could attempt to download a crafted JMAP blob ID of the form H\u003cemailid\u003e-\u003cindex\u003e, which could read past the end of the internal blob_headers array during download, exposing adjacent heap memory.",
